  "findings": [
    "Secondary free preflight completed both arms with 24/24 physical services. Its B8 automated keyword reference already improved restricted mean over finite B5 without a model; this is not proof of a model-specific advantage.",
    "Physical demands in the generator are explicit or one of three narrow arithmetic templates with a literal received public building ID. B8 can request the same finite building check without solving arithmetic; actual quantity comes from the source, not model output.",
    "Original B6 outcomes in the first two closed matched seeds are slower than competent B5, while faster than broad B8. Both comparisons must remain visible. Third seed is excluded from this read-only snapshot because B6/B8 had not both closed.",
    "Noise family changes seeds relative to the original family; between-family differences cannot identify the causal effect of noise alone. For that contrast predeclare fixed seed, cohort, policies and varying noise only.",
    "K02 stops at physical cohort/trip completion; incomplete human/model source review at that stopping time is not K22 source recovery evidence. Do not relabel pending sources as interpreted.",
    "Semantic batch count is not the number of paid model calls; use actual provider/model usage. In the first original B6 report 21 batches coexist with 8 actual calls.",
    "Synthetic media descriptions and zero world semantic-error counters do not measure external semantic precision, vision/audio accuracy, or missed real needs.",
    "Use stronger context/constraint interaction scenarios only when they correspond to product inputs/actions: consented availability windows, changing routes affecting the same cargo, mixed skilled staff, receiver constraints and multi-owner service chains. Give all arms identical bytes and feasible tools, including cheap references.",
    "Preserve original failures/negative outcomes, zero/faster-reader and immediate-formal controls. Human reading/formal delay are uncalibrated sensitivity parameters, not field-derived productivity.",
    "No lives-saved, Gemini, GCP, human-comprehension or Top-1 guarantee follows from these internal comparisons."
  ]
